(403, 'Earthwork in excavation by mechanical\nmeans (Hydraulic Excavator)/Manual\nMeans for foundations and floors of the\nbridges, retaining walls etc. including\nsetting out, dressing of sides, ramming\nof bottom, getting out the excavated\nmaterial, back filling in layers with\napproved material and consolidation of\nthe layers by ramming and watering etc.\nincluding all lift, disposal of surplus\nsoil upto a lead of 1000m, all types of\nshoring and strutting with all labour and\nmaterial complete as per drawing and\ntechnical specification as directed by\nEngineer in charge455555', 5, '2026-07-15 11:34:17', '2026-07-15 11:34:17'),
(404, 'Earthwork in excavation by mechanical\nmeans (Hydraulic Excavator)/Manual\nMeans for foundations and floors of the\nbridges, retaining walls etc. including\nsetting out, dressing of sides, ramming\nof bottom, getting out the excavated\nmaterial, back filling in layers with\napproved material and consolidation of\nthe layers by ramming and watering etc.\nincluding all lift, disposal of surplus\nsoil upto a lead of 1000m, all types of\nshoring and strutting with all labour and\nmaterial complete as per drawing and\ntechnical specification as directed by\nEngineer in charge.', 5, '2026-07-15 11:34:17', '2026-07-15 11:34:17'),
(405, 'Earthwork in excavation by mechanical means (Hydraulic Excavator)/Manual\nMeans for foundations and floors of the bridges, retaining walls etc. including\nsetting out, dressing of sides, ramming of bottom, getting out the excavated\nmaterial, back filling in layers with approved material and consolidation of\nthe layers by ramming and watering etc. including all lift, disposal of surplus\nsoil upto a lead of 1000m, all types of shoring and strutting with all labour and\nmaterial complete as per drawing and technical specification as directed by\nEngineer in charge.', 5, '2026-07-15 11:34:17', '2026-07-15 11:34:17'),
(406, 'Supply and Installation of High tensile steel wire mesh of Rhomboidal shape\n(mesh opening 80X150) with diameter of inscribed circle 65mm, tensile strength 1770N/mm2, punching\nstrength over the mesh according to\nISO 17746:2016 is 180 kN, Tensile\nstrength of mesh in the main direction\nis 150kN/m with wire dia 3.0mm,\nGalvanized ((90%Zn/ 10%Al) with\ncoating thickness 150g/m2 and twisted\nat the ends. All accessories such as clips\naccording to EN 13411-5, shackles as\nshown in drawings and as per technical\nspecifications etc. complete including\nall lead, lift and machinery.   done by iotblitz', 5, '2026-07-15 11:34:17', '2026-07-15 11:34:17'),
(407, 'ISO marked supplying and laying of\ngeosynthetic mat, three\n-dimensional\nmatrix having 6.5mm thickness as per\nEN ISO 9863\n-1, mass per unit area 600\ngrams/sqm, 6 kN/m tensile strength in\nlength direction\n&\n2 kN/m in cross\ndirection, at easily accessible location,\nwith all leads and lifts, manpower and\nmachinery, materials, labour etc.\ncomplete and as directed by Engineer\n-\nIn\n- Charge. The supplier to be an\nIndigenous manufacturer having a\nNABL accredited testing facility which\nwill be tested before the dispatch of\nmaterial by the Engineer\n-in\n-charge and\nthe material to be installed by or should\nbe installed under the supervision\nof specialized system provider', 5, '2026-07-15 11:34:17', '2026-07-15 11:34:17'),
(408, 'Providing and application of\nhydraulically applied erosion control\nproducts by means of hydroseeding/\nhydromulching on the hill side and\nvalley side slope surface for erosion\ncontrol by means of vegetation\nincluding safety, all other ancillary\nworks, material, machinery, labour,\netc., with all leads and lifts and as per\ndetailed technical specifications and as\ndirected by Engineer\n- In\n- Charge', 5, '2026-07-15 11:34:17', '2026-07-15 11:34:17'),
(409, 'Providing and laying in Reinforced\ncement concrete (M20) 1:1.5:3 nominal\nmix in foundation with crushed stone\naggregate 40 mm nominal size\nmechanically mixed, placed in foundation\nand compacted by vibration including\ncuring for 14 days.', 5, '2026-07-15 11:34:17', '2026-07-15 11:34:17'),
(410, 'Supplying, fitting and placing HYSD bar\nreinforcement in substructure complete as\nper drawing and Technical Specifications\nas per MORTH specification 1600 & 2200', 5, '2026-07-15 11:34:17', '2026-07-15 11:34:17'),
(411, 'ISO marked supplying and laying of\ngeosynthetic mat, three\n-dimensional\nmatrix having 6.5mm thickness as per\nEN ISO 9863\n-1, mass per unit area 600\ngrams/sqm, 6 kN/m tensile strength in\nlength direction\n&\n2 kN/m in cross\ndirection, at easily accessible location,\nwith all leads and lifts, manpower and\nmachinery, materials, labour etc.\ncomplete and as directed by Engineer\n-\nIn\n- Charge. The supplier to be an\nIndigenous manufacturer having a\nNABL accredited testing facility which\nwill be tested before the dispatch of\nmaterial by the Engineer\n-in\n-charge and\nthe material to be installed by or should\nbe installed under the supervision\nof specialized system provider.\n', 5, '2026-07-15 11:34:17', '2026-07-15 11:34:17'),
(412, 'Sourish-Earthwork in excavation by mechanical\nmeans (Hydraulic Excavator)/Manual\nMeans for foundations and floors of the\nbridges, retaining walls etc. including\nsetting out, dressing of sides, ramming\nof bottom, getting out the excavated\nmaterial, back filling in layers with\napproved material and consolidation of\nthe layers by ramming and watering etc.\nincluding all lift, disposal of surplus\nsoil upto a lead of 1000m, all types of\nshoring and strutting with all labour and\nmaterial complete as per drawing and\ntechnical specification as directed by\nEngineer in charge', 5, '2026-07-15 11:34:17', '2026-07-15 11:34:17'),
(413, 'Supply and Installation of High tensile\nsteel wire mesh of Rhomboidal shape\n(mesh opening 80X150) with diameter\nof inscribed circle 65mm, tensile\nstrength 1770N/mm2, punching\nstrength over the mesh according to\nISO 17746:2016 is 180 kN, Tensile\nstrength of mesh in the main direction\nis 150kN/m with wire dia 3.0mm,\nGalvanized ((90%Zn/ 10%Al) with\ncoating thickness 150g/m2 and twisted\nat the ends. All accessories such as clips\naccording to EN 13411-5, shackles as\nshown in drawings and as per technical\nspecifications etc. complete including\nall lead, lift and machinery.', 5, '2026-07-15 11:34:17', '2026-07-15 11:34:17'),
(414, 'Supply and installation of double\ncorrosion\n-protected multi strand\nprestressed cable anchors with initial\nprestress load > 1094kN (with min 6 no.s\nof 15.2 mm dia strands with breaking load\nper mono strand of 260.7 kN) and drill\nhole dia of 150 mm with full length\ngrouting in two phases (grout length for\nprestress varies from 15% to 30%),\nprotective sheath for exposed part above\nthe anchor head, centrallizers, including\nall ancillary items for anchoring, grouting\nand stressing on the slope surface along\nwith casing (if required) for drilling in\ncollapsible strata as per detailed technical\nspecifications and as directed by engineer\nin charge. Price inclusive of WPT at every', 5, '2026-07-15 11:34:17', '2026-07-15 11:34:17'),
(415, 'Cement pressure grouting through Hollow\nSoil Solid Rock Anchor of outer dia 76 in\nRock/Overburden including all cost of\nmaterial and equipments required to\ncomplete the grouting work at desired\npressure', 5, '2026-07-15 11:34:17', '2026-07-15 11:34:17'),
(416, 'Supply and Installation of ISO Certified\nSelf Drilling Anchors (SDA) - 38 mm\ndiameter, made of 40CR material with\nyield load more than or equal to 400 kN\nshall be used, it shall have a minimum drill\nhole diameter of 76mm. The base plate\nshall be of size (min.) 200 X 200 X 10mm,\nwhich should be secured with hexagonal\nnut, washer plate, base plate, coupler for\nconnecting bars, drill bit etc. The exposed\npart of SDA, nuts and bearing plate shall\nbe protected with suitable corrosion\nprotection coating and complete as per\ndetailed technical specifications and as\ndirected by Engineer\n- In - Charge. The supplier to be an\nIndigenous manufacturer having a NABL\naccredited testing facility which will be\ntested before the dispatch of material by\nthe Engineer-in-charge and the material to\nbe installed by or should be installed under\nthe supervision of specialized system\nprovider.\n', 5, '2026-07-15 11:34:17', '2026-07-15 11:34:17'),
(417, 'Providing subsurface drainage pipes\ninclined in the slope/weep holes with\nperforated PVC pipe (lined with Non -\nwoven Geotextile) of 76 mm internal\ndiameter by drilling and inserting the', 5, '2026-07-15 11:34:17', '2026-07-15 11:34:17'),
(418, 'Providing and laying CE/ISO/BIS\nMarked Needle Punched and\nMechanically Bonded TFI Non-Woven\nGeotextile indigenously manufactured\nfrom high quality polypropylene staple\nfibres (continuous filament will not be\naccepted) for separation, drainage and\nfiltration application with necessary\noverlaps as per the specifications with\nprior approval or directed by Engineerin-Charge', 5, '2026-07-15 11:34:17', '2026-07-15 11:34:17'),
(419, 'Clearance of vegetation on the crest and\nslope and disposal at dumping place\nwithin 1 km from the site as directed,\nincluding all material, labour,\nmachinery, etc. complete and as\ndirected by Engineer - In - Charge.', 5, '2026-07-15 11:34:17', '2026-07-15 11:34:17'),
